

UND = Undelete.

  This command will bring back the last item that was deleted with the
    EDIT MODE delete command.


UNDO = Undo the results of the last COPY, PASTE, or GM(GetMore) command.

              COPY, PASTE, and GM(GetMore) add a group of items to the end
              of the item list. The UNDO command simply deletes these items
              from the list. If any changes have been made since the
              COPY, PASTE, or GM command, the group UNDO will not function.





***** See "E" help re. Edit mode Left, Right, Up, Down commands.



